      "Phrase": "下一场是《绿野仙踪》。/n儿童部三年前也演过这个剧目。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060310",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606038,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 35,
      "SpeakerName": "导演",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "当时参演的人应该也不少，/n不过这次会重新分配角色，希望大家能展现新的表演。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060320",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606039,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 36,
      "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "是！",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060330",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "401"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606040,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 37,
      "SpeakerName": "导演",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那我宣布角色。/n首先，主演多萝西——",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060340",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606041,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 38,
      "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "然后，那里并没有念出我的名字。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060350",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "401"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606042,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 39,
      "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "分给我的角色是“南方女王格琳达”。/n偏偏是故事结尾才登场的“最强大的女巫”。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060360",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "401"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606043,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 40,
      "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "银河座是在戏剧圣地浅草也声名远扬的大剧团。/n儿童部自然也聚集着许多才华横溢的孩子。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060370",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "401"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606044,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 41,
      "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "分给我的是台词和动作都不多，但很有名的角色。/n大概是想同时顾及千寿家的颜面和舞台质量吧。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060380",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "401"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606045,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 42,
      "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "承担主要角色的不是我。/n毕竟银河座里，优秀的演员多如繁星。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060390",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "401"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606046,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 43,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "821",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "BgmFileName": "999",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.800000011920929,
      "FadeValue2": -0.5,
      "FadeValue3": 0.800000011920929
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606047,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 44,
      "SpeakerName": "历与伊吕波的祖母",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "伊吕波。",
      "BgmFileName": "6",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060400",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606048,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 45,
      "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "啊……那个……。/n祖母，非常抱歉。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060410",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
          "HeadDirectionMasterId": 4,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 40801,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "401"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606049,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 46,
      "SpeakerName": "历与伊吕波的祖母",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不必道歉。银河座的考虑我也很清楚。/n从你的现状来看，这是理所当然的决定。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060420",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606050,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 47,
      "SpeakerName": "历与伊吕波的祖母",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "马上就要升初中了吧。千寿历当年免试升入成年部，/n而你现在这个情况，恐怕做不到。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060430",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606051,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 48,
      "SpeakerName": "历与伊吕波的祖母",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "就算所属考试落选，也能继续留在儿童部，但你明白吧。/n好好想想自己应该做什么。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060440",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606052,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 49,
      "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……是。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060450",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 73,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 40801,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "401"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606053,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 50,
      "SpeakerName": "历与伊吕波的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "让大家看到你比上次演多萝西时进步了就好。/nSense 这种东西……也不是非有不可。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060460",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606054,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 51,
      "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060470",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 25,
          "SpineId": 40801,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "401"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606055,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 52,
      "SpeakerName": "历与伊吕波的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "作为千寿家的演员，/n我当然希望伊吕波能成为出色的演员。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060480",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606056,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 53,
      "SpeakerName": "历与伊吕波的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "离考试只剩一点时间了，/n先拼尽全力，争取在成年部也能有所表现吧。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060490",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606057,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 54,
      "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……谢谢您。/n我会努力的。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060500",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
          "HeadDirectionMasterId": 1,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 40801,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "401"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606058,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 55,
      "SpeakerName": "历与伊吕波的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "好了，你不是还要和千寿历一起练吗？/n已经没事了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060510",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606059,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 56,
      "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "谢谢您。/n……祖母、母亲，我先告退。",
      "SeFileName": "260",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060520",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 4,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 40801,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "401"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606060,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 57,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "1641",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.5,
      "FadeValue2": -1.0,
      "FadeValue3": 0.5
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606061,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 58,
      "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060530",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "SpineId": 40801,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "401"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606062,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 59,
      "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "要是我也有，像姐姐那样的……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060540",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 73,
          "HeadDirectionMasterId": 4,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 40801,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "401"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606063,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 60,
      "SpeakerName": "历与伊吕波的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "要是那孩子至少有 Sense 就好了。/n我们让她承受了这么痛苦的事……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060550",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606064,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 61,
      "SpeakerName": "历与伊吕波的祖母",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "大概是像她父亲吧。分配角色的决定是正确的。/n倒不如说，继续让她留在银河座，才会有损千寿之名吧？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060560",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606065,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 62,
      "SpeakerName": "历与伊吕波的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "他虽然也说“Sense 觉醒得比较晚”，可那也是小学时期。/n如果这孩子一直都无法觉醒 Sense……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060570",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606066,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 63,
      "SpeakerName": "历与伊吕波的祖母",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你有充分考虑过这种可能吗？/n……恐怕前所未有吧。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060580",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606067,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 64,
      "SpeakerName": "历与伊吕波的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……我不想放弃希望，/n但看她现在的样子，果然很难升入成年部吗。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060590",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606068,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 65,
      "SpeakerName": "历与伊吕波的祖母",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "当然。尤其你自己曾作为 Dai Star 担任招牌演员，/n不是最清楚现实吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060600",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606069,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 66,
      "SpeakerName": "历与伊吕波的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……可是，她是我的女儿。/n如果连我都不相信她，未免太可怜了……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060610",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606070,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 67,
      "SpeakerName": "历与伊吕波的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……呜……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060620",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606071,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 68,
      "SpeakerName": "历与伊吕波的祖母",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "作为母亲爱孩子的心情我理解。/n可是我们生来就肩负着比这更沉重的责任。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060630",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606072,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 69,
      "SpeakerName": "历与伊吕波的祖母",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "切不可忘记这一点。/n再这样下去，也会影响作为继承人的千寿历。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060640",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606073,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 70,
      "SpeakerName": "历与伊吕波的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "是。/n如果她自己希望继续，我也想让她继续……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060650",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606074,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 71,
      "SpeakerName": "历与伊吕波的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……或许，差不多该做出决定了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060660",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606075,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 72,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "1131",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "BgmFileName": "999",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.800000011920929,
      "FadeValue2": -0.5,
      "FadeValue3": 0.10000000149011612
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606076,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 73,
      "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "该怎么做，我心里其实已经有了答案。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060670",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "401"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606077,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 74,
      "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不能再犯那样的错。/n在银河座这个世界里，我的存在对千寿家并不是好事。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060680",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "401"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003606078,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 75,
      "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "时间流逝，我升入初中。/n然后，我……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20036060690",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "401"
    }
  ]
